                  <provenance type="#c" cert="low"><orgName role="fmo" key="org_601">Worcester,
                        Worcestershire. Benedictine cathedral priory of St Mary the
                        Virgin</orgName><p>Papal letter to Roger, bishop of Worcester (s. xii) added
