                           et con prec xiii s viii d</q> (s. xiv).</p><p>Letter and book list on
                        fol. 190r printed by Bannister in <title>EHR</title> 3,2 (1917), p.
                        387.</p><p> </p></provenance>
                  <provenance type="#rejected"><orgName role="fmo" key="org_278">Keynsham, Somerset,
